# What each scene read from assets.bin beyond what its level gives away,
# recorded on the console. dreamcast/build_asset_scenes.py puts a scene's
# level header, level model, object map and level-model textures, and these
# ranges, into the scene's pack, which the scene gate reads in one pass when
# the scene starts loading. A range missing here still works: it is read from
# assets.bin on its own, which can cause a short pause.
#
# Regenerate from a TEX_TRACE=1 log with dreamcast/record_scenes.py.
# Format: scene LEVEL OFFSET:SIZE ...   (hex)
